    "synthesis_rationale": "The calibration treats the Lamag overturn probability as anchored near a very low base rate due to large margin and procedural barriers. Upward pressure from Sabah petition activity and the existence of rare overturns creates a small residual risk, but the dominant downward forces (margin, timelines, lack of Lamag petition) lead to a posterior around 1%. Correlations among factors are acknowledged; the net update remains consistent with a low-probability outcome and a tight uncertainty range."
  }
}

